   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Telling a sequence of events",
     "texto": [
      "To order events you can use **først** («first», already known), **deretter** («then») and **til slutt** («lastly»). If one of these markers comes at the start, the conjugated verb takes second place: **Deretter laget hun en plan**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "More regular past tenses",
     "texto": [
      "Some common verbs have a past in **-et** and **-te**: starte → startet, lage → laget, diskutere → diskuterte. The past form stays the same with «I», «you» and «she»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
